    "name": "templinio",
    "skemo": "ske_01M6XW0NG95V9C0JRCMQJKXQKE",
    "description": "A timeline: shows what happened in the order of time. It styles the platform's own ordered list <ol>; every <li> holds a <time>, a title (a heading or <strong>) and what happened, its status in data-status – done, current or upcoming. A sign of its own shape stands at the start of every entry, a line joins the signs, and the status is heard as a word: never a colour alone."
  },
